Package: yamagi-quake2-ref-vk
Architecture: amd64 arm64
Depends: yamagi-quake2 (>= 8.70~), libvulkan1, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Vulkan renderer for Yamagi Quake II
 The vkQuake2 Vulkan renderer ported to Yamagi Quake II, installed next to
 the engine in /usr/lib/yamagi-quake2. Select it in the video menu or with
 "+set vid_renderer vk".
